@base = http://localhost:8080
# Replace studentId with the ID returned by the create request.
@studentId = 1

### Health
GET {{base}}/actuator/health

### List
GET {{base}}/api/students

### Create
POST {{base}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Amali Perera","email":"amali@example.com"}

### Read one (use the actual created ID)
GET {{base}}/api/students/{{studentId}}

### Update (both fields required)
PATCH {{base}}/api/students/{{studentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Amali Silva","email":"amali@example.com"}

### Invalid input -> 400
POST {{base}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":" ","email":"bad"}

### Delete -> 204
DELETE {{base}}/api/students/{{studentId}}
